	(text "Port B precharge + main contactor. FLT1/2 -> expander 1. Clamp SMAJ36A (blocks +36 V) + SMAJ12A: OUT >= -15.7 V.\nPort board (interfaces.DO): the K_x_MAIN line feeds the coil AND gates its low-side switch; the\ncoil's >= 50 V varistor is its only flyback path. At turn-off the gate falls with this output, the\ncoil current circulates in coil + varistor and this pin only pins the loop: VS - VOUT <= 42.1 V\n< 48 V abs max (check_coil_turnoff). Battery-type port (DAB both, PV-PORT B): TWO HVC43 coils\nin parallel, <= 0.60 A, not economised (pull-in = hold) -> ILIM 10k = 1.58-2.30 A (check_do_loads)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.576 205.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "06e05a48-803b-5b7b-bc60-0b5f54f03fdf")
	)
	(text "IMD switch N + spare. FLT1/2 -> expander 1. Clamp SMAJ36A (blocks +36 V) + SMAJ12A: OUT >= -15.7 V.\nPER-OUTPUT CAPABILITY (85 C ambient; calculated, not tested). Clamp energy every output: 0.5 J per\nturn-off, 0.5 W average (SMAJ12A 400 W/1 ms, ~150 W/10 ms, derated to 85 C).\nDO1 K_A_PRE   ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO2 K_A_MAIN  ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO3 K_B_PRE   ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO4 K_B_MAIN  ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO5 K_DISCH   ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO6 IMD_SW_P  ILIM 28.7k 0.52-0.82 A cont 0.5 A  inrush 0.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO7 IMD_SW_N  ILIM 28.7k 0.52-0.82 A cont 0.5 A  inrush 0.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)\nDO8 DO_SPARE  ILIM 10k   1.58-2.30 A cont 1.5 A  inrush 1.5 A x unlimited (<= continuous)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 320.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "17e7290e-7138-5e6c-aebd-f0c2589f2500")
	)
	(text "Port A precharge + main contactor. FLT1/2 -> expander 1. Clamp SMAJ36A (blocks +36 V) + SMAJ12A: OUT >= -15.7 V.\nPort board (interfaces.DO): the K_x_MAIN line feeds the coil AND gates its low-side switch; the\ncoil's >= 50 V varistor is its only flyback path. At turn-off the gate falls with this output, the\ncoil current circulates in coil + varistor and this pin only pins the loop: VS - VOUT <= 42.1 V\n< 48 V abs max (check_coil_turnoff). Battery-type port (DAB both, PV-PORT B): TWO HVC43 coils\nin parallel, <= 0.60 A, not economised (pull-in = hold) -> ILIM 10k = 1.58-2.30 A (check_do_loads)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 205.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "371b42c1-58f2-5df8-9274-3d860ba5a2e5")
	)
