	(text "TPS16630 A (SHDN = DO_PWR_EN) -> 24V_DO_MID -> TPS16630 B (SHDN = CHB_OK_L) -> 24V_DO. ILIM 3.01k ->\n5.98 A (5.58-6.42 A) each. All eight outputs on: <= 1.51 A (two HVC43 coil pairs, not economised);\none output shorted: <= 3.81 A - the other outputs keep running (check_do_loads). Rails read back via\nexpander 2. While AUX-HV is the source both switches are held off (sheet 08)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 106.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4f827ed1-91fc-57c7-b539-8ac923531f3c")
	)
	(text "DOn_EN = DOn & GATE_EN (SN74LVC08A). 100k pull-downs: outputs off while CTRL is\nabsent or in reset. K_DISCH (DO5) is held on only while both channels are healthy."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 312.352 96.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5819a0b4-a358-5d21-b14b-90ab55e93b53")
	)
